+	 * TLV 0x17 of the capability response is time_freq_hz: the rate the firmware believes its own
+	 * always-on counter runs at. cnss2 keeps it as plat_priv->device_freq_hz and divides the counter by it
+	 * to turn device ticks into microseconds. It is the firmware's own statement of what clocks WLAON —
+	 * and WLAON is what times the GDSC power-down handshake the firmware dies waiting for. Having the
